# GemGrade Code Standard

Before considering any task complete, verify and improve where needed:

- Mobile experience
- Desktop experience
- Dark theme consistency
- Performance impact
- Accessibility
- Error handling
- Visual consistency
- Loading states
- Empty states
- Responsive layout

Do not mark work done until gaps in this list are fixed or explicitly called out with a reason.
